{"source":"2fe20894bbec40eaa5e23537da3fad9d","folderId":"ff7ded71be6042c89e202bf37cbc72ec","values":{"settings":{"layout":{"id":"side"},"header":{"linkText":"","linkURL":"","logoURL":"NO_LOGO","logoTarget":"","social":{"facebook":false,"twitter":false,"bitly":false}},"appGeocoders":[{"singleLineFieldName":"SingleLine","name":"Adressen (BAG)","placeholder":"","url":"https://services.arcgisonline.nl/arcgis/rest/services/Geocoder_BAG_RD/GeocodeServer"}],"layoutOptions":{"layoutCfg":{"size":"medium","position":"left"},"socialLinks":false},"theme":{"colors":{"name":"side-default-1-modified","themeMajor":"white","dotNav":"#C00000","panel":"#FFFFFF","media":"#EEEEEE","text":"#000000","textLink":"#555","softText":"#c0c0c0","softBtn":"#C09600","esriLogo":"black"},"fonts":{"sectionTitle":{"id":"default","value":"font-family:'open_sansregular', sans-serif;"},"sectionContent":{"id":"default","value":"font-family:'open_sansregular', sans-serif;"}}}},"title":"GEO-informatie","story":{"storage":"WEBAPP","sections":[{"title":"<span style=\"font-size:40px\">GEO-informatie</span>","content":"<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>Wat hebben wij aan geo-informatie?</strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong><a data-storymaps=\"MJ-ACTION-1643627079539\" data-storymaps-type=\"media\">UtrechtopdeKaart</a></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Raadpleegomgeving met een legio aan&nbsp;thema's die spelen bij de gemeente Utrecht.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>OntwerpStudioRuimte</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Informatieprodukten gemaakt door OntwerpStudioRuimte</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a data-storymaps=\"MJ-ACTION-1643627608606\" data-storymaps-type=\"media\">Meerjaren Perspectief Ruimte</a></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a data-storymaps=\"MJ-ACTION-1643641362576\" data-storymaps-type=\"media\">Religieus Erfgoed</a></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a data-storymaps=\"MJ-ACTION-1643641402079\" data-storymaps-type=\"media\">Referentiewoningen</a></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a data-storymaps=\"MJ-ACTION-1643641430317\" data-storymaps-type=\"media\">Warmteprofielen</a></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a data-storymaps=\"MJ-ACTION-1643641486561\" data-storymaps-type=\"media\">Groenmonitor</a></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a data-storymaps=\"MJ-ACTION-1643641514882\" data-storymaps-type=\"media\">Evenementenlocaties</a></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a data-storymaps=\"MJ-ACTION-1643641543390\" data-storymaps-type=\"media\">Openbare stroompunten</a></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a data-storymaps=\"MJ-ACTION-1643641569974\" data-storymaps-type=\"media\">Startpagina Merwedekanaalzone</a></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a data-storymaps=\"MJ-ACTION-1643641804226\" data-storymaps-type=\"media\">Hitteplan verkoelingskaart</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong><a data-storymaps=\"MJ-ACTION-1643966816271\" data-storymaps-type=\"media\">RSU 2040 - ruimtelijke plannen zonder ruimtelijke weergave</a></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In Ruimtelijke Strategie Utrecht 2040 (RSU 2040) staan de visie en ambities&nbsp;die de gemeente Utrecht heeft op de grote vraagstukken voor de stad, nu en in de toekomst.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Klik <a href=\"https://utrecht.bestuurlijkeinformatie.nl/Agenda/Document/dedcc939-ae80-46dc-a5b4-c980f12c082b?documentId=d8d154f1-628e-4ece-9442-72f0ac8c1263&amp;agendaItemId=07474971-31c5-490a-b44b-21a50f2a0ebe\" target=\"_blank\">hier</a> voor het volledige document.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Klik <a href=\"https://omgevingsvisie.utrecht.nl/de-koers/ruimtelijke-strategie-utrecht-2040/samenvatting/\" target=\"_blank\">hier</a> voor een samenvatting van de RSU 2040.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Tegen welke problemen lopen we nog aan:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">​Delen van data; diversiteit van systemen maar van data niet (altijd) mogelijk</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Het vinden van data, het gebruik hiervan en/of ondersteuning krijgen om dit toe te passen in je werk</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Delen van informatie met andere afdelingen</span></li>\n</ul>\n","contentActions":[{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1586863750117","type":"navigate","index":-1},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1586863759051","type":"navigate","index":-1},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1586863768722","type":"navigate","index":-1},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1586863778209","type":"navigate","index":-1},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1586863787052","type":"navigate","index":-1},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1586873860705","type":"media","media":{"type":"webmap","webmap":{"id":"ed7d51eb5800470db8c163b5b4b1aa05","extent":null,"layers":null,"popup":null,"overview":{"enable":false,"openByDefault":true},"legend":{"enable":false,"openByDefault":false},"geocoder":{"enable":false},"altText":""}}},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1641564589568","type":"navigate","index":-1},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1641908566386","type":"navigate","index":-1},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1641908609810","type":"navigate","index":-1},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1641909292535-79648","type":"navigate","index":-1},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1642179410987-85530","type":"navigate","index":-1},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1642573349180","type":"navigate","index":-1},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1643627079539","type":"media","media":{"type":"webpage","webpage":{"url":"https://kaartenutrecht-gu-geo.opendata.arcgis.com/","type":"webpage","altText":"","display":"stretch","unload":true,"useParentOrigin":false}}},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-1643627608606","type":"media","media":{"type":"webpage","webpage":{"url":"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/apps/webappviewer/index.html?id=908cb02a49f54f20a78bef31f94a2a37","type":"webpage","altText":"","display":"stretch","unload":true,"useParentOrigin":false}}},{"id":"MJ-ACTION-164362770534